[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 103 The French",
    "start": 0.71,
    "end": 4.652,
    "zh": "第103课 法语",
    "zh_hant": "第103課 法語"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "test",
    "start": 4.372,
    "end": 5.393,
    "zh": "测试",
    "zh_hant": "測試"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.754,
    "end": 9.695,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.535,
    "end": 11.516,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "How long did the exam last?",
    "start": 12.777,
    "end": 16.118,
    "zh": "考试持续了多长时间？",
    "zh_hant": "考試持續了多長時間？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "How was the exam, Richard?",
    "start": 17.859,
    "end": 20.52,
    "zh": "考试怎么样，理查德？",
    "zh_hant": "考試怎麼樣，理查德？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Not too bad.",
    "start": 20.761,
    "end": 22.401,
    "zh": "还不错。",
    "zh_hant": "還不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "I think I passed in English and Mathematics.",
    "start": 22.642,
    "end": 27.004,
    "zh": "我想我英语和数学及格了。",
    "zh_hant": "我想我英語和數學及格了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "The questions were very easy.",
    "start": 27.204,
    "end": 29.865,
    "zh": "题目都很简单。",
    "zh_hant": "題目都很簡單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "How about you, Gary?",
    "start": 30.245,
    "end": 32.366,
    "zh": "你呢，加里？",
    "zh_hant": "你呢，加里？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "The English and Maths papers weren't",
    "start": 33.967,
    "end": 37.529,
    "zh": "英语和数学试卷",
    "zh_hant": "英語和數學試卷"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "easy enough for me.",
    "start": 37.329,
    "end": 39.35,
    "zh": "对我来说不够简单。",
    "zh_hant": "對我來說不夠簡單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "I hope I haven't failed.",
    "start": 40.151,
    "end": 42.391,
    "zh": "我希望我没不及格。",
    "zh_hant": "我希望我沒不及格。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I think I failed the French paper.",
    "start": 42.892,
    "end": 46.053,
    "zh": "我想我法语没及格。",
    "zh_hant": "我想我法語沒及格。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "I could answer sixteen of the questions.",
    "start": 46.674,
    "end": 50.395,
    "zh": "我能回答十六道题。",
    "zh_hant": "我能回答十六道題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "They were very easy.",
    "start": 50.516,
    "end": 52.556,
    "zh": "那些都很简单。",
    "zh_hant": "那些都很簡單。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "But I couldn't answer the rest.",
    "start": 52.937,
    "end": 55.878,
    "zh": "但我答不了剩下的。",
    "zh_hant": "但我答不了剩下的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "They were too difficult for me.",
    "start": 56.138,
    "end": 58.839,
    "zh": "那些对我来说太难了。",
    "zh_hant": "那些對我來說太難了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "French tests are awful, aren't they?",
    "start": 60.2,
    "end": 63.542,
    "zh": "法语考试很糟糕，不是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "法語考試很糟糕，不是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I hate them.",
    "start": 64.082,
    "end": 65.483,
    "zh": "我讨厌它们。",
    "zh_hant": "我討厭它們。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I'm sure I've got a low mark.",
    "start": 65.783,
    "end": 68.864,
    "zh": "我肯定我得分很低。",
    "zh_hant": "我肯定我得分很低。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Oh, cheer up!",
    "start": 70.105,
    "end": 72.066,
    "zh": "哦，振作点！",
    "zh_hant": "哦，振作點！"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Perhaps we didn't do too badly.",
    "start": 72.727,
    "end": 76.148,
    "zh": "也许我们没考得太差。",
    "zh_hant": "也許我們沒考得太差。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "The guy next to me wrote his name",
    "start": 77.009,
    "end": 80.472,
    "zh": "我旁边那个家伙写了名字",
    "zh_hant": "我旁邊那個傢伙寫了名字"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "at the top of the paper.",
    "start": 80.192,
    "end": 82.295,
    "zh": "在试卷顶端。",
    "zh_hant": "在試卷頂端。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Yes?",
    "start": 82.536,
    "end": 83.497,
    "zh": "是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Then he sat there",
    "start": 84.098,
    "end": 86.041,
    "zh": "然后他坐在那里",
    "zh_hant": "然後他坐在那裡"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "and looked at it for three hours!",
    "start": 86.162,
    "end": 89.106,
    "zh": "看了它三个小时！",
    "zh_hant": "看了它三個小時！"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "He didn't write a word!",
    "start": 89.267,
    "end": 91.79,
    "zh": "他一个字都没写！",
    "zh_hant": "他一個字都沒寫！"
  }
]
